\section{This family takes a different sequence language}{


The other four functions accept mzLib's \code{FullSequence} notation and convert it; the crosslink
models \strong{reject it} and require raw UNIMOD brackets - \code{K[UNIMOD:1896]}. That is mzLib's
constraint, not a choice made here, and it is repeated in the result's \code{caveats}.

